MID_SV_StageAct_Kai1_m01_01: Hey, we're pretty good at this.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dit_m01_01: The crowd roars.
MID_SV_StageAct_Seo_m01_01: My performance has left a charge in the air.
MID_SV_StageAct_Led_m01_01: Hahaha! Well, I am the Rose of Caelus.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bel_m01_01: I'm humbled by the applause.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tal_m01_01: I'm also the best actor in Dagda, you see?
MID_SV_StageAct_Orh_m01_01: I'm thrilled they enjoyed this so much!
MID_SV_StageAct_Anh_m01_01: We appear to have carried it off perfectly.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia0_m01_01: Performing feels so good!
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia1_m01_01: Cheers and applause! I love it.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pet0_m01_01: It's neat that people enjoy this so much.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pet1_m01_01: I can't believe I'm getting applause.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hur_m01_01: Not too bad, if I do say so myself.
MID_SV_StageAct_Max_m01_01: I do have some acting experience...
MID_SV_StageAct_Jes_m01_01: Everyone loves a clown.
MID_SV_StageAct_Gol_m01_01: Are they cheering for me? Hehe...
MID_SV_StageAct_Gat_m01_01: I strive for perfection.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dan_m01_01: A master auteur—and a master thespian!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fab_m01_01: A trifling thing, to control the hearts of beasts.
MID_SV_StageAct_Esm_m01_01: My heart's still pounding!
MID_SV_StageAct_Mic_m01_01: Looks like we'll turn a tidy profit!
MID_SV_StageAct_Urs_m01_01: Hmhm! The applause is enough to make my\nears ring.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sim_m01_01: Man, we crushed it, didn't we?
MID_SV_StageAct_Lou_m01_01: I feel like I became my character!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fia_m01_01: I was completely immersed in my character...
MID_SV_StageAct_Die_m01_01: I don't like standing out. But, still...
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor0_m01_01: People clapping for ME? It's like a dream!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor1_m01_01: Feels weird to get this kinda praise.
MID_SV_StageAct_Set_m01_01: Who knew that life as a performer could be\nthis rewarding!
MID_SV_StageAct_Nin_m01_01: I could jump for joy. I really could.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bon_m01_01: I have years of experience to draw from.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tob_m01_01: Feelin' pretty good about this one!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lil_m01_01: There's gotta be money in this acting thing.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lys_m01_01: Hahaha! Who knew I was so skilled?
MID_SV_StageAct_Buc_m01_01: An ovation to shake the earth! I'm moved.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sci_m01_01: Tempestuous applause! Pleasing, if expected.
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo0_m01_01: I became someone else. I liked it!
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo1_m01_01: Feels good to put in a good performance!
MID_SV_StageAct_Oly_m01_01: Applause is like sunlight for this flower!
MID_SV_StageAct_Naz_m01_01: Hehe. They're all clapping for me!
MID_SV_StageAct_Sar_m01_01: That turned out so well!
MID_SV_StageAct_Dai_m01_01: Hah! I knocked 'em dead.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hal_m01_01: Who knew I was such a thespian?
MID_SV_StageAct_Guj_m01_01: Ahhh. Hear the crowd? I love that sound!
MID_SV_StageAct_Yan_m01_01: I did not expect this!
MID_SV_StageAct_Iio_m01_01: Did my feelings reach the audience?
MID_SV_StageAct_Pep_m01_01: May all hearts swell with joy!
MID_SV_StageAct_Noc_m01_01: My people would be shocked to see me now!
MID_SV_StageAct_Sop_m01_01: I'll even clap for myself after that!
MID_SV_StageAct_Cat_m01_01: What a burst of applause! All will know my name!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ned_m01_01: I didn't anticipate such applause.
MID_SV_StageAct_Zac_m01_01: Gettin' applause? But I didn't off anyone...
MID_SV_StageAct_Maj_m01_01: This crowd knows what's GOOD.
MID_SV_StageAct_Ven_m01_01: Hah hah hah ha— *cough*
MID_SV_StageAct_Ini_m01_01: The cheers are so loud! I'm going to faint.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jas_m01_01: That was a once-in-a-lifetime performance!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ale_m01_01: The audience is so moved... I'm honored.
MID_SV_StageAct_Cle_m01_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Mys_m01_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Nat_m01_01: This praise seems excessive, but I'm flattered.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hri_m01_01: I may as well take a moment to bask in the adoration\nof the crowd.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tro_m01_01: The crowd liked it, and that's what's important.
MID_SV_StageAct_Cen_m01_01: Acting is like any art. Practice the essentials, and\nyou'll succeed.
MID_SV_StageAct_Asw_m01_01: I am heartened that the audience enjoyed it!
MID_SV_StageAct_Kou_m01_01: Is this what it feels like to bring joy to people?
MID_SV_StageAct_Nuz_m01_01: Their applause rings out like a thunderstorm.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kir_m01_01: Time to start the Black-Swan Theater! Hehehe!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ism_m02_01: The whole cast deserves this, not just me.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kai0_m02_01: Everyone loved it as much as I did.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kai1_m02_01: I think I played my role pretty well.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dit_m02_01: The crowd's cheers sound like screams of pain...
MID_SV_StageAct_Seo_m02_01: A skilled diplomat must be a skilled actor.
MID_SV_StageAct_Led_m02_01: That's a nice ovation.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bel_m02_01: I'm glad for the smiles.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tal_m02_01: What a performance! Well worth the coin.
MID_SV_StageAct_Orh_m02_01: Heehee! I performed nicely, I think!
MID_SV_StageAct_Anh_m02_01: I think I truly connected with them.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia0_m02_01: That was fun, like I was part of the story.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia1_m02_01: I think I gave a natural performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pet0_m02_01: Acting is fun!
MID_SV_StageAct_Pet1_m02_01: I'm glad they liked it.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hur_m02_01: Hehe. I think they liked it.
MID_SV_StageAct_Max_m02_01: I guess I did as well as...him.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jes_m02_01: Deceive and entertain. That's the gig!
MID_SV_StageAct_Gol_m02_01: Huh! I guess they liked it. Hehehe.
MID_SV_StageAct_Gat_m02_01: We performed quite capably.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dan_m02_01: All in service to the audience!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fab_m02_01: I am an expert in concealing and assuming identities.
MID_SV_StageAct_Esm_m02_01: I wish my mom could see this!
MID_SV_StageAct_Mic_m02_01: It's nice everyone's enjoying it so much.
MID_SV_StageAct_Urs_m02_01: All that time memorizing the script really paid off.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sim_m02_01: I could get used to this.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lou_m02_01: I-I think they...loved it! What a relief!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fia_m02_01: What an honor. Oh, I can feel my cheeks flushing!
MID_SV_StageAct_Die_m02_01: A pretty good response.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor0_m02_01: Acting's kinda fun!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor1_m02_01: Ha! What would happen if we really went for it?
MID_SV_StageAct_Set_m02_01: Not a bad feeling, having one's performance\npraised.
MID_SV_StageAct_Nin_m02_01: The spirits also found it quite enjoyable.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bon_m02_01: Oho! I could grow to enjoy this.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tob_m02_01: That was pretty good fun!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lil_m02_01: That's right, clap for me!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lys_m02_01: I'd say they enjoyed that quite a bit!
MID_SV_StageAct_Buc_m02_01: My experience proves useful.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sci_m02_01: Did I take their breath away?
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo0_m02_01: Whew. Guess I did a good job!
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo1_m02_01: That was a good time. I'll have to practice more!
MID_SV_StageAct_Oly_m02_01: I have made the hearts of the audience bloom!
MID_SV_StageAct_Naz_m02_01: I was pretty good, huh?
MID_SV_StageAct_Sar_m02_01: The audience seemed to enjoy it.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dai_m02_01: There's nothing I can't do!
MID_SV_StageAct_Hal_m02_01: Stunts are fun, but acting's nice too!
MID_SV_StageAct_Guj_m02_01: A performance that sets a new standard!
MID_SV_StageAct_Yan_m02_01: I did well, didn't I?
MID_SV_StageAct_Iio_m02_01: Not a bad reaction.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pep_m02_01: To bask in such delight!
MID_SV_StageAct_Noc_m02_01: Maybe I'll get famous!
MID_SV_StageAct_Sop_m02_01: This should earn enough to pay my tab!
MID_SV_StageAct_Cat_m02_01: All this applause... Naturally, it's for me.
MID_SV_StageAct_Ned_m02_01: The audience seems satisfied.
MID_SV_StageAct_Zac_m02_01: Kind of nice, puttin' on a good show.
MID_SV_StageAct_Maj_m02_01: How do you like that? I'm a star now!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ven_m02_01: My name will be known far and wide!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ini_m02_01: They actually liked it? That's a relief.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jas_m02_01: They liked me, didn't they?
MID_SV_StageAct_Ale_m02_01: I'm glad to know I did well!
MID_SV_StageAct_Cle_m02_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Mys_m02_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Nat_m02_01: I think my enthusiasm won them over.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hri_m02_01: I honed my acting skills through deceiving foes\nin battle.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tro_m02_01: I'd say we gave them a good show.
MID_SV_StageAct_Cen_m02_01: Well, that seems to have come together nicely.
MID_SV_StageAct_Asw_m02_01: I am glad to bring comfort to people's hearts.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kou_m02_01: I don't deserve this applause...but it is gratifying.
MID_SV_StageAct_Nuz_m02_01: They were spellbound by my performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kir_m02_01: Hehehehe! More, MORE!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ism_m03_01: Did I manage to live up to the material?
MID_SV_StageAct_Kai0_m03_01: I wanna get better at this.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kai1_m03_01: Well, we got through it at least.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dit_m03_01: I would leave this to someone else.
MID_SV_StageAct_Seo_m03_01: This has revealed to me a new side of the theater.
MID_SV_StageAct_Led_m03_01: I'm capable of better.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bel_m03_01: A little clumsy, I admit...
MID_SV_StageAct_Tal_m03_01: If you wanna make a sale, you gotta know how\nto act.
MID_SV_StageAct_Orh_m03_01: It's fair to say I can do better.
MID_SV_StageAct_Anh_m03_01: Did I hit my cues?
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia0_m03_01: A lot of work goes into a good performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tia1_m03_01: I have a new admiration for talented actors.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pet0_m03_01: I'm just glad it's over.
