MID_SV_StageAct_Hur_m03_01: It was good, in its own way.
MID_SV_StageAct_Max_m03_01: Kinda brought back memories.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jes_m03_01: No fun when you can't hear the screams.
MID_SV_StageAct_Gol_m03_01: As long as they're not scared of me...
MID_SV_StageAct_Gat_m03_01: I am used to acting like someone else.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dan_m03_01: Did I fail to project the emotion?
MID_SV_StageAct_Fab_m03_01: Good enough for this rabble.
MID_SV_StageAct_Esm_m03_01: Hard to pretend you're something you're not.
MID_SV_StageAct_Mic_m03_01: Maybe all those bedtime stories I told Mu helped?
MID_SV_StageAct_Urs_m03_01: It appears negotiating and performance go hand\nin hand.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sim_m03_01: Sounds like they enjoyed it!
MID_SV_StageAct_Lou_m03_01: My heart's still pounding!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fia_m03_01: I'm glad I didn't get in the way...
MID_SV_StageAct_Die_m03_01: Good enough, probably.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor0_m03_01: We kinda pulled it off, I guess.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor1_m03_01: I should have gone deeper into that role.
MID_SV_StageAct_Set_m03_01: Was that performance worthy of staging?
MID_SV_StageAct_Nin_m03_01: I wonder if that was what people wanted.
MID_SV_StageAct_Bon_m03_01: Even a stiff-necked fellow like me can stumble\nthrough a few lines.
MID_SV_StageAct_Tob_m03_01: As long as I didn't scare 'em, I count that as a win.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lil_m03_01: I'm not half bad at acting, huh?
MID_SV_StageAct_Lys_m03_01: That went better than I feared.
MID_SV_StageAct_Buc_m03_01: A little clumsy, wasn't it?
MID_SV_StageAct_Sci_m03_01: I suppose I didn't set their hearts aflutter.
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo0_m03_01: Aw, that was kind of embarrassing.
MID_SV_StageAct_Moo1_m03_01: I thought I was acting naturally...
MID_SV_StageAct_Oly_m03_01: That was hardly my best performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Naz_m03_01: That was good, but I can do better.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sar_m03_01: That was so nerve-racking...
MID_SV_StageAct_Dai_m03_01: Whew. Glad that's over.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hal_m03_01: I can think of a trick or two to improve that.
MID_SV_StageAct_Guj_m03_01: Acting, telling stories... It's all the same!
MID_SV_StageAct_Yan_m03_01: I was able to express myself.
MID_SV_StageAct_Iio_m03_01: More tiring than I thought.
MID_SV_StageAct_Pep_m03_01: That result does not befit our station.
MID_SV_StageAct_Noc_m03_01: Guess I'm good at more than fighting.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sop_m03_01: I had some fun with that!
MID_SV_StageAct_Cat_m03_01: People are just...forgetting to clap. They'll do better\nnext time.
MID_SV_StageAct_Ned_m03_01: At least we got through it OK.
MID_SV_StageAct_Zac_m03_01: Not so bad...you know?
MID_SV_StageAct_Maj_m03_01: Hey! Make some noise!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ven_m03_01: Haha. Alright, alright—keep it coming.
MID_SV_StageAct_Ini_m03_01: I don't love the attention. Still, I did my best.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jas_m03_01: At home on the stage!
MID_SV_StageAct_Ale_m03_01: Was I a little awkward up there?
MID_SV_StageAct_Cle_m03_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Mys_m03_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Nat_m03_01: I'd say I gave a fine enough showing.
MID_SV_StageAct_Hri_m03_01: That went rather well, didn't it?
MID_SV_StageAct_Tro_m03_01: Not a bad performance, if you ask me.
