MID_SV_StageAct_Asw_m03_01: Politics is also a performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kou_m03_01: I think I managed to sell the character.
MID_SV_StageAct_Nuz_m03_01: I'm grateful to have a receptive audience.
MID_SV_StageAct_Kir_m03_01: Listen to 'em squeal! They love me!
