MID_SV_StageAct_Hur_m04_01: There's more to it than reciting lines.
MID_SV_StageAct_Max_m04_01: Guess I'm no good at lying...
MID_SV_StageAct_Jes_m04_01: Heh heh HEH! Eat it, suckers!
