MID_SV_StageAct_Gat_m04_01: Utterly shameful.
MID_SV_StageAct_Dan_m04_01: Ohh, to disappoint my audience... It wounds me!
MID_SV_StageAct_Fab_m04_01: Flew right over their empty heads.
MID_SV_StageAct_Esm_m04_01: Look, I'm not an actor, OK?
MID_SV_StageAct_Mic_m04_01: I thought my performance was...realistic...
MID_SV_StageAct_Urs_m04_01: Projecting emotions is...more difficult than I thought.
MID_SV_StageAct_Sim_m04_01: Maybe I overestimated myself here...
MID_SV_StageAct_Lou_m04_01: I knew I should have memorized the script...
MID_SV_StageAct_Fia_m04_01: My mind went blank and I just...I just...
MID_SV_StageAct_Die_m04_01: I don't know why I'm even involved with this.
MID_SV_StageAct_Lor0_m04_01: Acting is stupid anyway...
