MID_SV_StageAct_Moo1_m04_01: That did feel like a stiff performance.
MID_SV_StageAct_Oly_m04_01: From even abject failure, I shall rise!
MID_SV_StageAct_Naz_m04_01: Argh! Whose idea was it to cast me?!
