MID_SV_StageAct_Ini_m04_01: I'm sorry. My nerves got to me.
MID_SV_StageAct_Jas_m04_01: Now that...did not go well.
MID_SV_StageAct_Ale_m04_01: I'm so embarrassed!
MID_SV_StageAct_Cle_m04_01: 
MID_SV_StageAct_Mys_m04_01: 
